  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Stella Blue** (1 review): Reviewer describes the stretch from Birdsong through Stella Blue as an epic, trance-inducing musical journey [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **High Time**: rare: 13 archived performances [5]\n- **That's It For The Other One**: back after 223 archived shows (2730 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **That's It For The Other One**: back after 223 archived shows (2730 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2023-05-20.aud.cm3.nico11104.flac24** (recommended): audience recording; 20 songs; 193 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Ambient chatter and crowd reactions come through well, giving the recording a feel like old-school tapes [4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer attended and saw no tapers on the floor; considered it a good show in a great venue [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2023-05-20.aud.cm3.nico11104.flac24**: taped by Fred Nicolois; transferred by Fred Nicolois; source: Aud>CM3>F3 [1]. Also: Line Audio CM3 microphones in ORTF into a Zoom F3, recorded 32-bit float at 48 kHz, converted to FLAC [1]",
